{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-systems","title":"记忆系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/foundations/memory-systems","wordCount":1111,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"记忆系统\">记忆系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>记忆系统存在的根本原因是 <strong>LLM 本身无状态</strong>——每次调用都从零开始，上下文窗口之外的一切都不存在。记忆系统就是给这个无状态的计算过程人为地加一层「过去」。</p>\n<p>理解记忆系统要抓住三个维度的权衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间维度</strong>：短期记忆活在上下文窗口里，随会话结束消失；长期记忆落在外部存储里，跨会话持久。二者不是对立的，而是同一信息在不同生命周期上的两个阶段。</li>\n<li><strong>检索维度</strong>：存进去不等于用得上。记忆的价值取决于「在需要的时刻能否被准确召回」，因此检索机制（语义相似、结构化查询、重要性加权）往往比存储本身更关键。</li>\n<li><strong>成本维度</strong>：记忆不是免费的——存得越多，检索越慢、噪声越大、Token 消耗越高。因此遗忘和整合（consolidation）与记忆同等重要，把短期记忆提炼成长期知识、把低价值信息淘汰，是维持系统长期可用的必要动作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三者对应本文后续「三类记忆模型」「记忆检索」「记忆管理策略」三节，可视为从表示、存取到维护的完整闭环：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>对应章节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>信息该活多久？</td>\n<td>短期记忆与长期记忆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索</td>\n<td>需要时能否找到？</td>\n<td>三类记忆模型、记忆检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>何时该忘、该提炼？</td>\n<td>记忆管理策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    I[&quot;交互&quot;] --&gt; ST[&quot;短期记忆&lt;br/&gt;上下文窗口&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; LT[&quot;长期记忆&lt;br/&gt;外部存储&quot;]&#10;    ST --&gt;|整合| LT&#10;    LT --&gt;|检索| R[&quot;推理&quot;]&#10;    ST --&gt; R\">graph LR\n    I[\"交互\"] --&gt; ST[\"短期记忆&lt;br/&gt;上下文窗口\"]\n    I --&gt; LT[\"长期记忆&lt;br/&gt;外部存储\"]\n    ST --&gt;|整合| LT\n    LT --&gt;|检索| R[\"推理\"]\n    ST --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"为什么-agent-需要记忆\">为什么 Agent 需要记忆</h2><p>LLM 本身是无状态的——每次调用都是独立的，没有对之前交互的记忆。Agent 的记忆系统弥补了这一缺陷，使其能够在长时间的任务执行中保持上下文连贯性，并从过去的经验中学习。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    U[&quot;用户交互&quot;] --&gt; STM[&quot;短期记忆&lt;br/&gt;当前对话上下文&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; LTM[&quot;长期记忆&lt;br/&gt;跨会话持久化&quot;]&#10;    STM --&gt; A[&quot;Agent 推理&quot;]&#10;    LTM --&gt; A&#10;    A --&gt; R[&quot;行动与输出&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt;|更新| STM&#10;    R --&gt;|持久化| LTM\">flowchart TD\n    U[\"用户交互\"] --&gt; STM[\"短期记忆&lt;br/&gt;当前对话上下文\"]\n    U --&gt; LTM[\"长期记忆&lt;br/&gt;跨会话持久化\"]\n    STM --&gt; A[\"Agent 推理\"]\n    LTM --&gt; A\n    A --&gt; R[\"行动与输出\"]\n    R --&gt;|更新| STM\n    R --&gt;|持久化| LTM</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"短期记忆与长期记忆\">短期记忆与长期记忆</h2><p>Agent 的记忆系统分为短期记忆和长期记忆，类似于人类的工作记忆和长期记忆：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记忆类型</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>容量限制</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短期记忆</td>\n<td>LLM 上下文窗口</td>\n<td>单次会话</td>\n<td>受 Token 限制</td>\n<td>对话历史、中间结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期记忆</td>\n<td>外部存储</td>\n<td>跨会话持久</td>\n<td>理论上无限</td>\n<td>用户偏好、知识库、历史经验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass, field&#10;from datetime import datetime&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class MemoryEntry:&#10;    content: str&#10;    timestamp: datetime&#10;    importance: float&#10;    memory_type: str&#10;    metadata: dict = field(default_factory=dict)&#10;&#10;class MemorySystem:&#10;    def __init__(self, short_term_limit: int = 20):&#10;        self.short_term: list[MemoryEntry] = []&#10;        self.long_term: list[MemoryEntry] = []&#10;        self.short_term_limit = short_term_limit&#10;&#10;    def add_short_term(self, content: str, importance: float = 0.5):&#10;        entry = MemoryEntry(&#10;            content=content,&#10;            timestamp=datetime.now(),&#10;            importance=importance,&#10;            memory_type=&quot;short_term&quot;&#10;        )&#10;        self.short_term.append(entry)&#10;        if len(self.short_term) &gt; self.short_term_limit:&#10;            self._consolidate()&#10;&#10;    def _consolidate(self):&#10;        high_importance = [&#10;            m for m in self.short_term if m.importance &gt; 0.7&#10;        ]&#10;        for entry in high_importance:&#10;            entry.memory_type = &quot;long_term&quot;&#10;            self.long_term.append(entry)&#10;        self.short_term = self.short_term[-self.short_term_limit:]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass, field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datetime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datetime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timestamp: datetime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    importance: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    memory_type: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metadata: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default_factory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemorySystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, short_term_limit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term: list[MemoryEntry] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.long_term: list[MemoryEntry] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> short_term_limit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add_short_term</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, content: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, importance: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MemoryEntry(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">datetime.now(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            importance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">importance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            memory_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"short_term\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term.append(entry)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term_limit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._consolidate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _consolidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        high_importance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.importance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high_importance:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            entry.memory_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"long_term\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.long_term.append(entry)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.short_term_limit:]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"三类记忆模型\">三类记忆模型</h2><p>借鉴认知科学，Agent 的长期记忆可以细分为情景记忆、语义记忆和程序记忆三种类型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    LTM[&quot;长期记忆&quot;] --&gt; EP[&quot;情景记忆&lt;br/&gt;Episodic&quot;]&#10;    LTM --&gt; SM[&quot;语义记忆&lt;br/&gt;Semantic&quot;]&#10;    LTM --&gt; PM[&quot;程序记忆&lt;br/&gt;Procedural&quot;]&#10;    EP --&gt; E1[&quot;过去完成的任务&quot;]&#10;    EP --&gt; E2[&quot;交互历史片段&quot;]&#10;    SM --&gt; S1[&quot;事实与知识&quot;]&#10;    SM --&gt; S2[&quot;概念与关系&quot;]&#10;    PM --&gt; P1[&quot;工具使用模式&quot;]&#10;    PM --&gt; P2[&quot;问题解决策略&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    LTM[\"长期记忆\"] --&gt; EP[\"情景记忆&lt;br/&gt;Episodic\"]\n    LTM --&gt; SM[\"语义记忆&lt;br/&gt;Semantic\"]\n    LTM --&gt; PM[\"程序记忆&lt;br/&gt;Procedural\"]\n    EP --&gt; E1[\"过去完成的任务\"]\n    EP --&gt; E2[\"交互历史片段\"]\n    SM --&gt; S1[\"事实与知识\"]\n    SM --&gt; S2[\"概念与关系\"]\n    PM --&gt; P1[\"工具使用模式\"]\n    PM --&gt; P2[\"问题解决策略\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记忆类型</th>\n<th>存储内容</th>\n<th>检索方式</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>情景记忆</td>\n<td>具体经历和事件</td>\n<td>时间/情境相似性</td>\n<td>带时间戳的向量存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义记忆</td>\n<td>事实、概念、知识</td>\n<td>语义相似性搜索</td>\n<td>知识图谱、向量数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程序记忆</td>\n<td>技能、策略、模式</td>\n<td>任务类型匹配</td>\n<td>结构化规则库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EpisodicMemory {&#10;  event: string;&#10;  context: string;&#10;  timestamp: Date;&#10;  outcome: &#39;success&#39; | &#39;failure&#39;;&#10;  lessons: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SemanticMemory {&#10;  fact: string;&#10;  source: string;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  embedding: number[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ProceduralMemory {&#10;  taskType: string;&#10;  strategy: string;&#10;  steps: string[];&#10;  successRate: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface AgentMemory {&#10;  episodic: EpisodicMemory[];&#10;  semantic: SemanticMemory[];&#10;  procedural: ProceduralMemory[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EpisodicMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=