pan style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memories]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        combined </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(texts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"将以下内容压缩为简洁的摘要:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">combined</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Agent 记忆系统弥补了 LLM 无状态的缺陷，分为短期记忆和长期记忆两大类。</li>\n<li>长期记忆借鉴认知科学分为情景记忆、语义记忆和程序记忆三种类型。</li>\n<li>记忆检索通常采用相关性、时效性、重要性的三因子综合评分策略。</li>\n<li>随着记忆积累，需要滑动窗口、摘要压缩、重要性过滤等管理策略来控制规模。</li>\n<li>有效的记忆系统是 Agent 持续学习和长期任务执行的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"记忆系统","id":"记忆系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么 Agent 需要记忆","id":"为什么-agent-需要记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"短期记忆与长期记忆","id":"短期记忆与长期记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"三类记忆模型","id":"三类记忆模型"},{"level":2,"text":"记忆检索","id":"记忆检索"},{"level":2,"text":"记忆管理策略","id":"记忆管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规划与推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/foundations/planning-and-reasoning"},"next":{"title":"函数调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/tool-use/function-calling"}}